    "Deleted legacy relations excluded, stopped sales do not revoke already held legacy eligibility, ambiguous tenant-role ownership rejected",
    "CUSTOM directory omissions, local display overrides, disabled resources and formal offline state preserved; no role-grant resurrection",
    "Historical source revocation reuses normal consumption ledger, preserving overlapping sources and queued finite renewals",
    "V15 appended to identity migration manifest; existing assigned instances retained as ASSIGNED with no fabricated adoption metadata",
    "Platform application catalog registration no longer grants built-in tenant roles or depends on role repositories",
    "Explicit identity-http platform-administrator preview/adopt endpoints, shared across hosts; no submitted versions, resource sets or historical activation times",
    "Bounded namespaced HTTP diagnostics and supported shared locale keys"
